"""Conversion: BAC 2016 – اللّغة العربيّة وآدابها – شعبة لغات أجنبيّة – الموضوع الثّاني (عبد الله الرّكيبيّ، القصّة القصيرة الجزائريّة).
2016 had one ordinary session (header: «دورة: 2016»).
Exam (most faithful source): gdrive 1cDvXvymcohRIm_YbUpcwg5mPp1Tp8NV0 (بكالوريا العربية 2016 شعبة لغات.docx);
same paper as PDF (owner's copy): gdrive 1Tkt8BFSBLdjk1C_TyCscbyJHOircJepb (BAC 2016 - اللغة العربية - لغات أجنبية.pdf);
official ONEC paper: gdrive 1QrXTAPtKWLgkHDz1B6a3qIymOqlAXXnU (01_الموضوع.pdf, pages 3–4 — used to check the docx);
official mark scheme (ONEC «الإجابة النّموذجيّة»): gdrive 1WXyJSZlfGaDINHCwWRNhqxYl_C-Zc-qP (02_التصحيح.pdf, pages 3–4).

Method (same as the BAC 2017–2023 converters): the verbatim strings below (text, reference, glossary, question texts)
were generated from the .docx with python-docx (runs read exactly; only outer whitespace and edge direction marks
trimmed) and re-checked programmatically against it; the docx was compared with the official ONEC paper (same five
paragraphs and questions; the ONEC text opens with «... نشأت», the docx without the leading dots — the docx is kept).
The correction PDF's text layer is reversed presentation-form Arabic, so the mark scheme was read from the rendered pages
(150 dpi, fully legible). Every mark comes from the official scheme; correct options and explanations condense its wording.

Conversion notes / points for the owner's review:
- Streams: header of the paper and of the correction: «لغات أجنبيّة» ⇒ LANG.
- docx defects fixed from the ONEC paper: the part-3 quotation is split over two docx paragraphs at a line wrap ⇒ joined
  with a space; it contains a stray letter «قيَمٍس» ⇒ «قيَمٍ» (ONEC «قِيَمٍ»).
- «n×m» rule used in the 2016 converters: distinct required parts ⇒ one element per part; a list of interchangeable
  items or of aspects forming one answer ⇒ one element.
- Q1 «2×0.75» = when + how it started (two elements). Q2 «3×0.5», Q3 «2×0.75», Q4 «3×0.5»: aspects forming one answer
  ⇒ one element each. Q5: 0.5 type (التّفسيريّ) + «3×0.5» three indicators among four; only الحواريّ / الإيعازيّ as
  distractors (the text narrates a history and describes realism ⇒ السّرديّ / الوصفيّ avoided). Q6: 0.5 genre (مقال نقديّ)
  + «3×0.5» three features among five. No summary in this subject (the scheme's part 1 sums to 10 without one).
- Part 2: Q1 «4×0.25» four synonyms (one element; «اليقظة / الطّفرة / الحركة» not used as distractors). Q2: three
  separate lines (الحروف 0.5 / الأسماء 0.25 / الضّمائر 0.25; «لم» is in paragraph 1 but not in the scheme ⇒ no «حرف
  نفي» distractor). Q3 «2×0.5» = meaning + function («التّوكيد» not used as a distractor). Q4, Q5: 0.5 per word /
  sentence (no «نعت / عطف بيان» distractor for «اليقظة»). Q6 «4×0.25» = النّوع (مجاز مرسل) / العلاقة / الشّرح /
  البلاغة («مجاز عقليّ» and «استعارة مكنيّة» not used as distractors).
- Part 3 (04): 2 the explanation of the quotation (a model text with a quotation from عبد المالك مرتاض ⇒ deferred
  essay_builder, guide rule 11) + «4×0.5» four values among six («يكفي أن يأتي المترشّح بأربع قيم صحيحة») ⇒ interactive.
- Deferred: part 3 explanation 2 points.
"""
